msgstr "DShot 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qiotek-zealoth7.rst:507
#: 69a6a91d9f9943e8b567574c6888163c 84de1700aa7c42b9b0e0adf705bd9263
#: 8f6ff2e7621649538e7865010a65214f 9f61675de6764182a56381c4bad82a85
#: d1b7d1d5badd4637a38dc00dfb851d17 d4ce65ddd5d74bd1b5d9e3a59c1cdbd5
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4/13/14, 5/6/7/8, 9/10/11/12. Outputs 13 and"
" 14 cannot support Dshot, only PWM, so if 3 and four are set to DShot, 13 "
"and 14 cannot be used."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但混合使用 DShot 和普通 PWM 的输出受到分组限制，即在某组中为一个输出启用 "
"DShot，要求该组中所有输出均配置并使用 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须保持一致（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1/2、3/4/13/14、5/6/7/8、9/10/11/12。输出 13 和 14 不支持 "
"DShot，仅支持 PWM，因此如果 3 和 4 设置为 DShot，则 13 和 14 无法使用。"

